#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:307
msgid "Image Viewer Features"
msgstr "Image Viewer 功能"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:309
msgid ""
"<application>Image Viewer</application> has a variety of features to help "
"you view your images. You can zoom in and out or view the image full screen."
" Regardless of your zoom level, <application>Image Viewer</application> uses"
" a low amount of memory. You can also rotate and flip the image you are "
"viewing."
msgstr ""
"<application>Image Viewer</application> 提供多種功能來協助您檢視影像。您可以"
"放大、縮小或全螢幕檢視影像。無論縮放等級為何，<application>Image Viewer</"
"application> 使用的記憶體都很少。您也可以旋轉或翻轉您正在檢視的影像。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:314
msgid ""
"The collection view allows the viewing and editing of large image "
"collections. In this view image operations can be applied to all selected "
"images at once."
msgstr ""
"集合檢視可讓您檢視與編輯大型影像集合。在此檢視中，影像操作可以一次套用至所有"
"選取的影像。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:318
msgid ""
"<application>Image Viewer</application> has special support for digital "
"camera pictures and displays EXIF metadata recorded with the image. This "
"feature requires <systemitem class=\"library\">libexif</systemitem> to be "
"installed on your system. All modifications made in JPEG images are "
"lossless. That is, saving rotated and flipped JPEG images will not "
"recompress the image. Beside this all available metadata (like EXIF) will be"
" preserved and updated accordingly."
msgstr ""
"<application>Image Viewer</application> 特別支援數位相機照片，並會顯示影像記"
"錄的 EXIF 中繼資料。此功能需要在系統安裝 <systemitem class=\"library\">"
"libexif</systemitem>。JPEG 影像的所有修改都是無損的，也就是說，儲存旋轉或翻轉"
"過的 JPEG 影像不會重新壓縮影像。此外，所有可用的中繼資料（如 EXIF）都會保留並"
"適時更新。"

